    <p>Invest in a few key pieces that fit well and feel comfortable. You will wear them for months, and they can be worn again in future pregnancies or after delivery.</p>

    <h2>When to Call Your Clinician</h2>

    <p>Contact your healthcare provider if you experience:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Regular contractions before 37 weeks</li>
      <li>Fluid leaking from the vagina</li>
      <li>Severe headache that does not resolve with acetaminophen</li>
      <li>Visual changes (blurring, flashing lights, floaters)</li>
      <li>Sudden swelling of hands, face, or eyes</li>
      <li>Decreased fetal movement after 24 weeks</li>
    </ul>

